{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18628","headline":"酬贾鹏山人郡内新栽松寓兴见赠二首 一 · 柳宗元","name":"酬贾鹏山人郡内新栽松寓兴见赠二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳巧自爲别，无心乃玄功。\n夭夭日放花，荣耀将安穷。\n青松遗涧底，擢莳兹庭中。\n积雪表明秀，寒花助葱茏。\n贞幽夙有慕，持以延清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}